    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectApproached? THEN\n\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToStorage\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO CheckObjectProperties\n\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
